// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_conhost_headless_powershell.yml
// ID Sigma: 056c7317-9a09-4bd4-9067-d051312752ea
// Título: Powershell Executed From Headless ConHost Process
// Descripción: Detects the use of powershell commands from headless ConHost window.
The "--headless" flag hides the windows from the user upon execution.

// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_conhost_headless_powershell.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\conhost.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "CONHOST.EXE") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "--headless" and ProcessCommandLine contains "powershell")
